# {{.Name}}

A plugin for [Matinee](https://matinee.yeix.io).

```sh
go test ./...                                  # the server part's tests
matinee-plugin scan path/to/a/folder           # what it makes of each file
matinee-plugin try path/to/a/folder            # browse and play in a browser
matinee-plugin build                           # {{.ID}}.matinee-plugin, ready to install
```

The developer guide: https://matinee.yeix.io/docs/plugins/overview/
